  "details": "1. Begin process of creating new instance for any world.\n\n2. Set to Group hosting\n\n3. Click \"Who Can Join?\". \n\nThe modal popup allows you to select who can join the instance, but lacks an OK or Cancel button, instead only offering a back arrow.\n\nClicking the back arrow is unintuitive and feels like an undo or cancel rather than a confirmation.\n\nAdd \"Ok\" and \"Cancel\" buttons instead.",
